# DNA-AND content · elements (all 118)
# researched: IUPAC periodic table (atomic numbers, symbols, names, groups); standard states at room temperature;
#   natural vs lab-made from standard chemistry references; melting and boiling points in kelvin at 1 atmosphere
#   from standard reference tables (CRC Handbook values, rounded); "unknown" where never measured. The in-game uses come from the public Elements page.
# Spec: docs/CONTENT-FORMAT.md · wiki/systems/r06-planet.md · content/physics.dnat

